      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Board shall make a determination and notify the member, his Commanding Officer and the Reviewing Officer of its decision within seven days after the meeting at which a grievance is considered. Where the matter is not adjusted, the Board shall refer the grievance to the Police Commissioner for final determination.",
