      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(d) Step 4. - Where the grievance is not adjusted at Step 3 and the Board refers the grievance to the Police Commissioner for final determination the Police Commissioner shall make his determination within twenty days of receipt of the grievance. This determination shall be made after appropriate consultation with any or all parties to the grievance, including the Chairman of the Board and/or the Board members.",
